{"id":"3d6117e6c491100d","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-thm-gandy-forcing.md","title":"Gandy–Harrington Generic Real","display":"thm-gandy-forcing — Gandy–Harrington Generic Real","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-gandy-forcing","aliases":["58-thm-gandy-forcing"],"display":"thm-gandy-forcing — Gandy–Harrington Generic Real","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-lightface.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-countable-transitive-model.md]]","[[58-df-generic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-gandy-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-gandy-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-gandy-forcing — Gandy–Harrington Generic Real"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"255364c0a7fc9610\" href=\"?note=255364c0a7fc9610\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-lightface.md\">../batch17/58-df-lightface.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"63e7f217bda9e077\" href=\"?note=63e7f217bda9e077\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-countable-transitive-model.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-countable-transitive-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"58-df-generic\">58-df-generic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-gandy-forcing-—-Gandy-Forcing\">thm-gandy-forcing — Gandy Forcing</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb G_{\\mathrm{GH}}\">\\(\\mathbb G_{\\mathrm{GH}}\\)</span> (Gandy–Harrington forcing of nonempty lightface analytic subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^\\omega\">\\(\\omega^\\omega\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (countable transitive model containing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb G_{\\mathrm{GH}}\">\\(\\mathbb G_{\\mathrm{GH}}\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>-generic filter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma^1_1\">\\(\\Sigma^1_1\\)</span> (lightface analytic pointclass, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"255364c0a7fc9610\" href=\"?note=255364c0a7fc9610\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-lightface.md\">../batch17/58-df-lightface.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CountableTransitiveModel}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CountableTransitiveModel}_S\\)</span> (countable transitive ZFC-model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"63e7f217bda9e077\" href=\"?note=63e7f217bda9e077\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-countable-transitive-model.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-countable-transitive-model.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}\\)</span> (generic-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"58-df-generic\">58-df-generic</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gandy\\text{-}harrington\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathbb G_{\\mathrm{GH}}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\Sigma^1_1:A\\ne\\emptyset\\},\\qquad \\forall A,B\\in\\mathbb G_{\\mathrm{GH}}\\;\\bigl(A\\le_{\\mathrm{GH}}B\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq B\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}gandy\\text{-}harrington\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathbb G_{\\mathrm{GH}}\\coloneqq\\{A\\in\\Sigma^1_1:A\\ne\\emptyset\\},\\qquad \\forall A,B\\in\\mathbb G_{\\mathrm{GH}}\\;\\bigl(A\\le_{\\mathrm{GH}}B\\leftrightarrow A\\subseteq B\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gandy\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{CountableTransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb G_{\\mathrm{GH}},\\le_{\\mathrm{GH}},M)\\to\\exists!x_G\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\{x_G\\}=\\bigcap G\\land x_G\\notin M\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}gandy\\text{-}forcing} \\vdash \\mathrm{CountableTransitiveModel}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,\\mathbb G_{\\mathrm{GH}},\\le_{\\mathrm{GH}},M)\\to\\exists!x_G\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\\{x_G\\}=\\bigcap G\\land x_G\\notin M\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This atom fixes “Gandy forcing” to mean the Gandy–Harrington forcing above; other uses of the name must not be conflated with it.</li>\n<li>The old unconditional properness and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>-preservation claim was not justified by the former undefined predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-gandy-forcing-—-Gandy-Forcing","text":"thm-gandy-forcing — Gandy Forcing","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-lightface.md","status":"resolved","id":"255364c0a7fc9610","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-lightface.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-countable-transitive-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"63e7f217bda9e077","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-countable-transitive-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-generic","status":"resolved","i